| AERO (medium) | CPBdBmnkA5.md | 6.00 | Reject | Different scope (architecture optimization). CCE is clearly stronger in practical impact and empirical validation. |
| FlashSampling (low) | V4Xs283LHH.md | 2.50 | Reject | Overclaimed speed/memory, unconvincing validation. CCE is far stronger in every dimension. |
