| Rethinking Stability-Plasticity (Dual-Arch) | `/home/wg25r/review_agent/human_reviews/YFdopzmpdr.md` | 5.20 | Similar issues (parameter efficiency overclaiming, compute concerns not discussed). SPARC has stronger empirical results but worse overclaiming on the "6%" headline. Roughly comparable. |
| Vision-Language CL | `/home/wg25r/review_agent/human_reviews/9aZ2ixiYGd.md` | 5.00 | Similar overclaiming (unfair comparison using ChatGPT/Sentence-Transformer). SPARC's DSC choice is at least explicit and part of the method, whereas the VL paper used hidden unfair advantages. SPARC slightly above. |
